    "body": "Stopped before claiming. Required dependencies are not available on upstream/main 475373093.\n\n#2217 is open. The main tree has no crates/gcode package. Its last progress comment records held work on mkinney:issue/2217-camcraft-gcode, without an open PR.\n\n#2584 is open. The main tree has no machine_model module. No open PR supplies that module.\n\n#2585 is in review in open PR #2778. Its pure machine limit API has not merged.\n\n#2583 has merged, but the other dependencies still prevent the complete headless check required here. Implementing the missing reader and machine model would work additional issues. No code changed, no claim was taken, and no tests ran.\n",
